window.products.push({"id":991148,"name":"Wine Glasses with Shark Inside, 2 PCS Transparent Unique Wine Glasses for Shark Lover Wedding Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Oh0ig63L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🍷1. Package including: A high-quality exquisite stemless wine glass. Color: Transparent, Theme: Shark. 🍷2. Production process: Hand-blown lightweight Shark wine glass are made from lead-free silicon that comes in direct contact with food. Our shark wine glasses go through four strict procedures: hot processing (lead removal, shaping), cold processing (grinding, polishing), deep processing (sculpture, combination) and quality control. 🍷3. Purely handmade: Our shark wine glasses are handmade by skilled artisans. The cup body is inverted using a log mold, and the shark sculpture is completely handmade. Each cup is unique. Although made by hand, our strict quality inspection can still ensure the high quality of products. 🍷4. Perfect annealing process: After shaping, our glasses are placed in a box electric cathode furnace for 30min and cooled slowly at room temperature after dropping to 100 degrees Celsius. The durability of the product is guaranteed, even if it is taken out in ice water and poured directly into boiling water, there is no problem. 🍷5. Rest assured to buy: It is very suitable as a birthday gift for shark lovers and decoration for families living by the sea. Of course, this exquisite and unique wine glass is suitable for all kinds of romantic gatherings of couples and friends. We are committed to providing satisfactory service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/514Oh0ig63L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Softfree","source_asin":"B09VTC3T28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VTC3T28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VTC3T28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
