window.products.push({"id":991208,"name":"PALANCHY Rechargeable Portable Humidifiers,Cool Mist mini Humidifier with Adjustable Angle,260ml Water Tank Small Humidifier USB and Battery Powered,7","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-7Zaai0sS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Compact Size with Adjustable Angle】- To break the disadvantages of traditional humidifiers, PALANCHY portable humidifier support adjustable misting angle by 180 degrees. This enables a bigger misting area and helps small water molecules moisturize the skin more deeply. With its small size(7.2in*2.8in), the small humidifier prefect for travel,car,desktop or small bedrooms. 2 replacement cotton swabs are included in the package for free. ✅【Portable & USB Charging 】- Enjoy humidification cordlessly or by any USB-port power sources. Take the mini humidifier with you anywhere! humidifier for plant,The cute humidifier runs for up to 4 hours on a single charge. ✅【Two Spray Modes & Auto Shut-Off 】- This personal humidifier has two mist modes: Continuous and intermittent mode. Please soak the cotton core for a few minutes when you use it for the first time. On continuous mode, the portable humidifier will automatically shut-off after 4 hours. On intermittent mode, the humidifier will automatically shut-off after 8 hours, effectively preventing dry burning accidents. ✅【Silent Operation & Colorful Cycling Night Light】- Silent operation below 30dB allows you to sleep tight in a quiet environment. There are 3 night light modes---colorful cycling, 7 color auto change and fix on specific color. The small humidifier creates a peaceful ambiance while delivering a soothing mist. You can enjoy a maximum relaxation and improve your sleeping quality. ✅【The Last Humidifier You Ever Need!】- Elegant! Portable! Rechargeable! Adjustable Angle! Night Light---Essential oil is not supported.For any questions at any time, please feel free to email us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-7Zaai0sS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PALANCHY","source_asin":"B08RSGL27C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991208","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RSGL27C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RSGL27C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
