window.products.push({"id":991416,"name":"AUJOY Wingback Chair Cover Slipcover Stretch 2-Piece Couch Covers Jacquard Spandex Fabric Wing Back Armchair Sofa Protector with Anti-Slip Foams and S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tb4CPQszL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To the modern decor, the home is never finished: It's always a work in progress. We are constantly changing the way it looks, rearranging the furniture, bringing in new pieces, changing the colors of our chairs. Solid coloring makes AUJOY slipcovers easily blend with our current color palette. Top quality materials with soft, breathable and skin-friendly features make it deeply favored by the world. ☑ Pet Friendly Protection People with pets are well aware of the struggle to win the never-ending battle against fur buildup. And if you’re not careful, your chair can quickly become a nest of unwanted fluff. This slipcover is a best pick for pet owners not only because it does a great job of protecting your wingback chair, but because it anchors foam rods to the seat to prevent slips caused by leaping cats and pups (or kids, for that matter). ☑Dust-proof Protection Our slipcover is totally dust-proof, we have taken use of the full-coverage cover for you, it will be a perfect protection from dirt, spills, food debris, footprints and Kids doodle. Great for those who are seeking the shields for furniture.Or if your wing chair is too old, don’t need to buy a new one. Just take our cover, it can freshen your chair up and give you a different visual effect. ☑High Stretch Differs from those cheap and common fabrics of others, this chair cover is crafted from spandex blend fabric, which makes it applicable to most wing chairs. And the elastic bottom hem wraps your sofa tightly to fit perfectly. Not easily deformed and more durable. If you have any confuses about how to install it after receiving or how to solve something during usage, you can contact with me directly, I will be happy to serve at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tb4CPQszL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUJOY","source_asin":"B07XLBWZYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XLBWZYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XLBWZYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":991417,"name":"Pack of 100PCS 10\" 25cm Black Fiber Diffuser Sticks Refill Fragrance Reed Diffuser Sticks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GmkUCs3TS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications Material: Polyester Size: Dia0.12\"*L9.84\" (Dia3mm*L25cm) Color: White / Black  Quantity: 100pcs / pack Package: OPP bag   You may have one luxury and beautiful bottle in your hand, then why not to make your own diffuser. It is easy to buy replacement for fragrance, solvent and sticks on or off line. For sticks, fiber sticks provide a better and more standard alternative. Tips: 1.As for the solvent, no matter oil base or water base, both are OK. 2.Do not add too much fragrance oil or essential oil into diffuser (as usual, 8%,10%, 12%,15% etc. ) . If too much,viscosity of the oil will be too heavy or thick to travel up the sticks. 3.Fill the diffuser bottles or containers to approximately 75 to 85 percent capacity with the diffuser oil. Do not fill the oil to the top of the containers––it may overflow when you put the sticks inside. 4.Add suitable quantity sticks into diffuser ( as usual 6pcs, 8pcs, 10pcs etc.), because different solvent, fragrance, proportion and bottle will get a different effect with the same sticks. Allow the sticks to sit in the oil for almost one hour. After that, oil will evaporate slowly. You could turn over the diffuser sticks to accelerate when to the bottom of the bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GmkUCs3TS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SCENTIA","source_asin":"B096811GVF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096811GVF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096811GVF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
