window.products.push({"id":991478,"name":"Le Creuset Toughened Nonstick 11-Inch Shallow Fry Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cOCvPP8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HA2200-28 Le Creuset proudly introduces Forged Hard-Anodized cookware - guaranteed to brown, saut and sear to perfection. Our unique manufacturing process delivers a premium product twice the strength of stainless steel and guaranteed to never warp. This new product line is dishwasher safe, induction efficient and oven safe to 500 F (glass lids to 325 F). Consumer focused features like a hollow cast stainless steel handle that remains cool while cooking on the stovetop and a metal-utensil safe nonstick coating make Forged Hard-Anodized practical, beautiful and irresistible - exactly what you expect from Le Creuset. Features & Benefits: -Forged Hard-Anodized Construction: More stable and stronger than cast aluminum, Le Creuset's Forged Hard Anodized line is constructed for maximum performance and stability. The surfaces are harder than stainless steel and will never warp due to the careful Hot Forging Process. Each pan perfectly absorbs, distributes, and transmits heat quickly and efficiently. -Special INDUCTION Compatible Base: This pan contains a magnetic stainless steel (18/0) disk within its innovative base. This ensures that the pan is suitable for all heat sources and cooktops. -Nonstick Interior and Exterior: Perfect for healthy cooking and extremely to clean. The non-stick surfaces are also safe to use with metal utensils. -Exclusive ''Stay Cool'' Handle Design: Each pan in features fully riveted, cast stainless steel sides and helper handles for safe and comfortable use. The V-shaped design works to keep the handle cool and keep you safe. -Premium Packaging: Each piece in this collection is housed in a stylish, full-color box - perfect for gift-giving. Each box is constructed of recycled and recyclable board. Additional Features: -Capacity markings on bottom of pan for easy use -Glass lids for easy viewing of foods -Light enough for everyday use, but still ''heavy,'' professional feel -Perfect for multi-use, not just for frying! Specifications: -Materia","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cOCvPP8JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B0725ZK3ZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991478","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0725ZK3ZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0725ZK3ZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
