window.products.push({"id":991496,"name":"Christmas Square Tablecloth - New Year Colorful Xmas Balls Hang on Pine Tree with Snowflake Baubles Ornaments Table Cloths for Traditional Winter Seas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lv5hTrrLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[TABLECLOTH FOR ROUND TABLES] - Great tablecloth for indoors and outdoors, perfect for all holidays and events. The cover displays lively imagery is perfect for your table. Decorate your tabletop for holiday, dinner or parties. ***Attention - the tablecloth size is NOT the table size. DO NOT forget the OVERHANG, please measure your table’s size before buying. [PREMIUM QUALITY ROUND TABLECLOTH] - VVA fitted tablecloths for round tables are made of 100% polyester skin friendly fabric, printed with high quality, high resolution images and feature a casual lightweight drape. Top quality cloth and exquisite workmanship ensure its anti-fading and shrinking resistance, and long-lasting durability. Its stain and wrinkle resistance features add a classy touch to any plain table, giving it seamless beauty. [SPILL PROOF & STAIN RESISTANT] - Our holiday table cloth is oil-proof, stain proof, scratch and water resistant. Leak proof, making it the perfect cover protector for your table. Great for home decor and families with kids and pets, helps avoid unexpected troubles and provides you with the greatest convenience. Machine washable in cold water. Reusable, easy to clean and maintain. Air dry or tumble dry on low. Warm ironing if needed. No bleaching. [VERSATILE TABLE PROTECTOR] - How to create the perfect dining atmosphere? The table cover is perfect for indoor/outdoor use, specially designed to match your holidays (such as CHRISTMAS, THANKSGIVING, HALLOWEEN and so on), weddings, BBQs, picnics, celebrations, catering events, cafes, special occasions, dinners, brunches, potlucks, buffets or party themes. [VIBRANT COLOR & BLUNDERING SIZE] - We offer unique design featuring vibrant colors and interesting patterns of pictures specializing fit for circular. They doesn’t cause any unpleasant odor. The images on the clothes are so VIBRANT and HIGH-DEFINITION, and resilient fabric won’t fade, rip or weather. This 60 inch is Tablecloth size.It is NOT the TABLE size. Recommended table size 28-43 Inches. Table size should be LESS THAN Tablecloth size, please measure your table size before buying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lv5hTrrLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VVA","source_asin":"B0836PMKVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0836PMKVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0836PMKVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
