window.products.push({"id":991611,"name":"Large Butter Dish with Lid Knife for Counter - Farmhouse Butter Holder Saver Countertop Round Butterdish Keeper Container Box…, Ceramic White, 6.5 × 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L-UM6UThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Features: We have designed a groove on the lid of the butter box for the butter knife, which is very convenient to use. This butter dish is made of top-grade porcelain, free from toxins and chemical ingredient. This upgraded butter dish with lid uses a high-quality silicone sealing ring. Simply rinse the bottom of the lid in water to clean. Please note, after washing, please wipe it dry and then dry it in the sun. Perfect capacity and dimensions Large enough to hold all sizes of butter, west coast butter, east coast butter, suitable for most brands. Double silicone seal Unlike the single-layer silicone commonly used in the market, the double-layer silicone is less prone to aging and has a more effective seal. Easy to clean Simply rinse the bottom of the lid in water to clean. Please note, after washing, dry it with a cloth or dry it in a cool place. The silicone ring can also be removed for cleaning. Tips: Please do not soak the cover in water for a long time to avoid the wood to expand. Specifications: Dimensions: 6.5\"L x 6.5\"W x 3\"H Large Capacity: It is wide and deep enough to hold 8 oz or two 4 oz sticks of butter Material: Ceramic container, wooden lid and stainless steel butter knife Accessories: A butter knife with ceramic handle and stainless steel cutter head Color:  WhiteAttention & Tips: Dishwasher safe only for dish and knife not the lid, the lid only wash by hands. Please do not clean with steel wool as it may cause abrasions over time. Please do not soak the lid in water for a long length of time as this will cause the wood to expand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L-UM6UThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BY91KK6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY91KK6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY91KK6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":991612,"name":"4 Fast Food Trays 14 inch x 18 inch Black Café Standard Cafeteria, Restaurant, Pizza, Diner Serving Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ARkWLYOfL._AC_.jpg","description":"For durable, long-lasting service, even under heavy use, trust your fast food service to the ChefGiant 14 x 18 brown plastic fast food tray! A thick, reinforced rim with corner ribs adds impact strength to this tray, to reduce breakage and minimize warping. When not in use, this tray is designed to stack with similar trays to speed up drying and prevent sticking. This tray's weave-grain textured finish provides a reduced-slip resistance to minimize spills by keeping product in place. This same finish also ensures a polished presentation by hiding everyday wear and tear - scratches included - that would be otherwise visible on a non-textured tray. This tray is perfect for fast food, fast casual, and quick service restaurants, and for cafeteria dining, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ARkWLYOfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChefGiant","source_asin":"B01KYA95B0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991612","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KYA95B0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KYA95B0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
