window.products.push({"id":991659,"name":"Valentine Day I Love You Balloons and Heart Balloons Kit with 1000 Pcs Dark-Red Silk Rose Petals Wedding Flower Decoration Love-Bear Red Heart Balloon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HHqqCKrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUS VALENTINES PARTY DECORATIONS - This is a complete valentine's day decorations kit, include I LOVE YOU letter balloons, 25 red heart-shaped latex Valentine's balloons, 6 red heart-shaped foil balloons, ribbon, Love-bear foil balloon, and 1000 Pcs silk rose petals. This valentines day decorations kit will make a unique and luxurious valentine's party. 1000 PCS SILK ROSE PETALS - How could a Valentine's Day decoration be without rose petals? The highest quality polyester silk material rose. Non-toxic and will not fade from sun or liquid. It appears extremely realistic. Making it a great add-on for your Valentine party, anniversary, wedding, proposal, confession, the romantic night. HIGH QUALITY - Our valentine balloons made of High-quality latex material and It won't leak easily. Love Foil valentines balloons look so cute after filled. All balloons support helium filling. Red ribbon includes tying balloons. You can tie the balloon where you want, or fill it with helium, tie it to a red ribbon and float it from the ceiling. It will be a romantic evening just for your love. ROMANTIC DECOR KIT - On the floor, in the bathtub, on the bed covered with our romantic rose petals, so many balloons to decorate the whole room. With the red heart-shaped balloons floating on the ceiling, I believe that when your lover sees the \"I LOVE YOU\" balloon, the heart with a hit and will be a huge surprise. CUSTOMER SERVICE - Strictly control the integrity of products so there is usually no shortage of parts. Support refund or resend for any missing or damaged parts in your package. We have a special after-sales team. please feel free to contact us for the first time and we will solve it for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HHqqCKrmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vstarner","source_asin":"B09PDFVMQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDFVMQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDFVMQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":991660,"name":"Folkulture Set of 3 Boho Tapestry Wall Hanging for Bedroom Décor of Teen Girls, Boho Decorations, Wall Art Posters for Room Aesthetic or Wall Decor, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jvs-BNYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL: These small hippie aesthetic tapestries are made of 100% cotton making it lightweight and soft to touch. The 16 x 20 inch tapestry is full of charm and whimsy being the perfect size to hang anywhere. MULTIPLE PATTERNS TO CHOOSE FROM: This cute tapestry is the perfect yellow room decor for teen girls. It comes in multiple designs to choose from- the simple and aesthetic tapestry called Good Vibes, the subtle but spirital tapestry named Boho Vibes, the warm Desert with the beautiful palm tree, the beautiful and radiant tarot wall hanging and the embroidered Radiate Love tapestry that is handstitched. CAN BE HUNG ANYWHERE: This sun and moon tapestry for bedroom aesthetic has been designed in a way that it can be placed anywhere- be it your study or work desk at office as an aesthetic wall décor, or your bedroom for a vintage wall décor look or your home entryway or dorm room to add to your bohemian room decor. THOUGHTFUL GIFT: This neutral tapestry is just the perfect gift for a hostess, Halloween, Christmas, Thanksgiving or even as a housewarming gift. These aesthetic posters make an ideal living room decor, modern farmhouse decor, boho spring decor or a simple wall decor. EASY TO MAINTAIN WITH NO ASSEMBLY REQUIRED: The sunset tapestry should be hand washed for long-term use.. Please use mild detergent with cold water. Do not iron these cool posters. Do not scrub it hard and prevent sharp things and insolation. The wall hangings have two loops stitched on top to hang it onto a hook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jvs-BNYqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Folkulture","source_asin":"B097RHMNGM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097RHMNGM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097RHMNGM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":991661,"name":"UA Creations Hand Painted Lacquered Pysanka Wooden Egg on Holder, Large Fancy Petrykivka Ethnic Style Easter Souvenir from Ukraine in a Gift Box, Jumb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818+TJzqJ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Through the centuries Pysanka Eggs have been bringing peace and prosperity to the homes of their owners. Once YOU take this folk-art masterpiece in your hands, you will not want to give it away! This unique Pysanka Egg comes to you from the heart of Europe - Central Ukraine. It is professionally painted by an artist in the original Ukrainian manner called \"Petrykivka\" or \"Petrikov\". Petrykivka decorative painting is characteristic of contemporary Ukrainian ornamental folk art, and it dates back to the 17th century. This technique is the finest example of unique Slavic art culture, creating an emotional reflection of the communion of humans and nature. Petrykivka painting combines a plentitude of plant ornaments, particularly flowers, with elements of a fantasy fauna (firebirds, phoenix or roosters) and mirrors the unity of physically real nature with the spiritual world, the idea of recurrence of life and endless rebirth. The United Nations recognized this manner of hand painting as a unique form of intangible traditional practices of European culture. This decorative egg is carefully made of plain birch wood. After painting work, each item requires four coats of lacquer finish, which gives it a deluxe glossy surface. The painting on this egg is signed by the artist to prove its authenticity. The item is sold in a quality white cardboard box, ready for your gift message. This original Decorated Pysanka Egg will definitely be an elegant Easter gift and Mothers day gift for your loved ones!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818+TJzqJ7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UA Creations","source_asin":"B01N5UGLEB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N5UGLEB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N5UGLEB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
