window.products.push({"id":991705,"name":"Gifts for Women Throw Blankets Baby Warm, for Sofa, Bed,Living Room, Durable Home Decor Flannel Blanket for Adult and Kids (50\"x40\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AGzFTazmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material Description: Made of anti-pilling flannel for added comfort and warmth. The fiber is super soft, comfortable, lightweight, warm and breathable. It also has anti-wrinkle and anti-fading properties without having to worry about falling off. Wash separately with cold water and then dry at low speed.Size:50''x40'', 50''x60'', 60''x80''.Suitable For Children, Adults, Parents And Grandparents!Easy Wash And Care - Very Easy To Care For Your Blanket. Just Machine Wash On Cold And Air Dry. Made With Wrinkle Resistant Fabric. Stays The Same And As New, After Every Wash. Always Wash Fleece Alone Or With Other Fleece Blankets And Clothing That Is Similar In Texture To Prevent Abrasion. Never Use Bleach On A Fleece Blanket.Durable and elaborate advanced craftsmanship, suitable for outdoor, indoor, swimming, and sofa blankets. You can also provide the perfect gift choice for your child, girlfriend, wife, daughter, son, son or any loved one on birthday, anniversary, Valentine's Day and Christmas.Elegant Comfort Coral Flannel Micro-fleece Blanket Gives You The Benefit Of Warmth Without Excessive Weight And Bulk Like Other Fabrics Do.Blanket Gives An Innovative Accent Of Nature To Your Home By The The Pleasure Look And Feeling Of Real Microfleece Without Harming Any Animal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81AGzFTazmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Autoreuse","source_asin":"B08YQT7TTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YQT7TTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YQT7TTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":991706,"name":"Suzy Toronto Cocktail Napkins, Birthdays Are Good, 20-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrFp3VCqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Join the fun with inspiring, uplifting, and empowering napkins from Suzy Toronto and Ideal Home Range (IHR). Suzy believes that inside each woman lives a whimsical enchanted creature, and she loves to create designs that celebrate the enduring bond and empowering sisterhood of women. Suzy has designed each of these napkins with her most popular and powerful one-liners on the front of the napkin, and a corresponding message on the back. Cocktail size napkins are 5 by 5-Inch when folded. Napkins are soft and absorbent 3-ply and come in packages of 20. Birthday, congratulations, encouragement, or for any occasion - Suzy Toronto napkins are a great gift for a special woman in your life. Made in Germany by IHR using manufacturing processes including water based colors on oxygen-bleached cellulose, paper from managed forests, and soy-based ink. In 1977, Ingrid and Hanjö Rick conceived the idea of producing accessories in the arts and crafts tradition in order to communicate their concept of interior design. The first headquarters of their company IHR was an old village school in Lower Saxony in the north of Germany. The young company grew steadily, becoming the trendsetter in its line of business and is today considered to be the international market leader in the field of high-class table decoration and interior accessories. Bring IHR to your table today and you'll be happy you did.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrFp3VCqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suzy Toronto","source_asin":"B005GD8JB8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-991706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005GD8JB8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005GD8JB8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
